              <h2>What Is Postural Instability?</h2>

              <p>
                Postural instability is a neurological condition affecting body balance, posture control and movement stability. Patients may experience unsteady standing, difficulty walking, falls risk and reduced confidence during movement.
              </p>

              <p>
                At Health Vision Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation in Jayanagar Bangalore, we provide advanced neuro physiotherapy focused on improving balance, posture control, walking stability and functional independence.
              </p>

              <h2>Common Symptoms of Postural Instability</h2>

              <ul>
                <li>Difficulty maintaining balance</li>
                <li>Frequent imbalance or falls</li>
                <li>Unsteady standing posture</li>
                <li>Difficulty walking steadily</li>
                <li>Reduced coordination and control</li>
                <li>Fear of falling</li>
                <li>Reduced movement confidence</li>
                <li>Difficulty performing daily activities</li>
              </ul>

